  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Information and Return Counselling Centre Berlin - 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s overall objective is to provide support to migrants interested in returning voluntarily to their countries of origin by enabling them to make an informed decision. The counselling service consists of impartial open-ended consultations addressing topics such as return-assistance measures, situation in the country of origin as well as the possibilities of reintegration assistance upon return. A strong network of partners will further develop the referral mechanism for migrants with specific needs or vulnerabilities and improve tailored counselling.</narrative>
  </description>
